title: Nutanix Prism: VM NICs (API v4)
agents: nutanix
catalog: virtual/nutanix
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check shows the virtual NICs of a Nutanix VM with MAC address, model,
 VLAN mode and the IP addresses learned by the hypervisor. The service goes
 WARN if a NIC of a running VM is disconnected. On VMs which are not running,
 disconnected NICs are only shown.

 This check requires the Nutanix Prism special agent for API v4 (agent_prism_v4).

discovery:
 One service is created for every VM with at least one NIC.
